{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22526","headline":"与诸同年贺座主侍郎新拜太常同宴萧尚书亭子 · 白居易","name":"与诸同年贺座主侍郎新拜太常同宴萧尚书亭子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宠新卿典礼，会盛客徵文。\n不失迁莺侣，因成贺燕羣。\n池台晴间雪，冠盖暮和云。\n共仰曾攀处，年深桂尚熏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22526.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22526","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}